LASHA SHAHE MAZLOOM KA RETI PA PADA HAI<br>
AUR KHOON MEIN DOOBI HUWI MAQTAL KI FAZA HAI<br>
<br>
Ye kaisi qayamat Shah-e-Bekas pe hai aaye <br>
Akber hai na Qasim hai na Abbas sa bhaye<br>
Kya Aalam-e-Ghurbat mein ghata zulm ki chaye <br>
Ab tegh ke neeche isi bekas ka gala hai<br>
<br>
Go subha se laate rahe ansaar ke laashe<br>
Shabbir the khud teen shabo roz ke pyaase<br>
Karta raha har haal mein jo shukr ke sajde<br>
Sar us Shah-e-Mazloom ka naize pa chadha hai<br>
<br>
Begor-o-Kafan khaak pa hai lasha-e-Sarwar<br>
Abbas-e-Ali sogaye shaano ko katakar<br>
Qaimo mein bapa Aal-e-Payambar ke hai mehshar<br>
Faryad hai naale hain gham-o-Aaho buka hai<br>
<br>
Kehti hai ye masoom sakina mere baba<br>
Har gaam pa dete hai sitamgar mujhe eiza<br>
Ab pyaas ki shiddath se mera jalta hai seena<br>
Mujh bekas-o-mazloom pa ye kaisi jafa hai<br>
<br>
Allah wo kya Sham-e-Ghareeba ka samaa&rsquo;n tha<br>
Nazroo&rsquo;n mein to namoos ke tareek jahaa&rsquo;n tha<br>
Jalte huwe qaime the har ek simt dhuaa&rsquo;n tha<br>
Hatho mein shaqi ke sare Zainab ki rida hai<br>
<br>
Daswi(10) ko moharram ki qayamat huwi barpa<br>
Larza thi zameen aur falak kaamp raha tha<br>
